  "writes.text_11_1": "Every wall can hide a secret, check them closely.",
  "writes.text_12_1": "A stranger wrote something on this wall",
  "writes.text_12_2": "[???] Yo i've lost my access code for the waterland storage room do anyones has it ?",
  "writes.text_12_3": "[???] Hi, sorry for the delay between my answer and your query, yes i have the code, 74258. Regards.",
  "block.special_dungeon_reloaded.waterblockportal": "Water block",
  "writes.text_13_1": "So many doors, there is only two correct, the rest are vaccuming your soul.",
  "block.special_dungeon_reloaded.brownslab": "brown stairs",
