  "item.special_dungeon_reloaded.hd_4_spawn_egg": "Heart dog Spawn Egg",
  "writes.text_14_1": "These are all the heart dogs remaining, there is a total of 4 heart to destroy to clear your way to the white door.",
  "writes.text_14_2": "The heart are located in these dungeons: Red, Brown, Orange and Cyan, find them and kill the heart dog",
  "writes.text_14_3": "When the heart dog die, the corresponding heart dog block will be destroyed automatically",
  "writes.text_14_4": "Hearts dogs are very resistant, so prepare your best gears and automation skills.",
  "writes.text_15_1": "Own reminder: i've added a code to the heart dog room, you'll need 2 blue key and this code: 559888",
  "writes.text_16_1": "I suggest you to remember the dogs blocks pattern in the level entrace, you'll need it later.",
  "writes.text_17_1": "Congrat, you have such a great memory, here is the code to access the room of my friend in the orange dungeon: 846956",
